#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:1
msgid "模块与参数管理"
msgstr "Module and Parameter Management"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:3
msgid "先查询当前环境中的真实模块，再配置参数；这页不列固定模块数量，避免安装版本不同导致照抄失败。"
msgstr ""
"Query modules in the current environment before configuring parameters. This page "
"avoids a fixed module count that can differ between installed versions."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:5
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"本页说明注册表、工作区自定义模块与预填充参数的关系。模块实现教程见 {doc}`custom_modules`，方法签名和返回结构以 "
"{doc}`api/registry` 为准。"
msgstr ""
"This page connects the registry, workspace custom modules and prefill parameters. See"
" {doc}`custom_modules` for implementation tutorials and {doc}`api/registry` for "
"method signatures and return structures."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:7
msgid "查询已注册模块"
msgstr "Query Registered Modules"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:9
msgid "注册表延迟发现内置模块。先查询实际安装环境中的标识符，再用于配置；不依赖文档中固定的模块数量或示例清单。"
msgstr ""
"The registry discovers built-in modules lazily. Query the identifiers in the "
"installed environment before using them in configuration; do not rely on a fixed "
"module count or example inventory in documentation."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:11
msgid ""
"from agentsociety2.registry import get_registry\n"
"\n"
"registry = get_registry()\n"
"for module_type, module_class in registry.list_env_modules():\n"
"    print(module_type, module_class.__name__)\n"
"\n"
"for agent_type, agent_class in registry.list_agent_modules():\n"
"    print(agent_type, agent_class.__name__)\n"
msgstr ""
"from agentsociety2.registry import get_registry\n"
"\n"
"registry = get_registry()\n"
"for module_type, module_class in registry.list_env_modules():\n"
"    print(module_type, module_class.__name__)\n"
"\n"
"for agent_type, agent_class in registry.list_agent_modules():\n"
"    print(agent_type, agent_class.__name__)\n"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:22
msgid ""
"`get_module_info(module_type, kind)` 返回描述和构造参数；`kind` 为 `env_module` 或 "
"`agent`。查询时使用上一步返回的标识符。"
msgstr ""
"`get_module_info(module_type, kind)` returns descriptions and constructor parameters;"
" `kind` is `env_module` or `agent`. Use an identifier returned by the preceding "
"query."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:24
msgid "发现工作区自定义模块"
msgstr "Discover Workspace Custom Modules"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:26
msgid ""
"workspace-root/\n"
"├── custom/\n"
"│   ├── agents/\n"
"│   ├── envs/\n"
"│   └── skills/\n"
"└── .agentsociety/\n"
"    └── prefill_params.json\n"
msgstr ""
"workspace-root/\n"
"├── custom/\n"
"│   ├── agents/\n"
"│   ├── envs/\n"
"│   └── skills/\n"
"└── .agentsociety/\n"
"    └── prefill_params.json\n"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:36
msgid "`custom/agents/` 和 `custom/envs/` 放置 Python 模块；`custom/skills/` 放置智能体技能，两者使用不同的注册表。"
msgstr ""
"`custom/agents/` and `custom/envs/` contain Python modules; `custom/skills/` contains"
" agent skills. They use separate registries."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:38
msgid ""
"from pathlib import Path\n"
"from agentsociety2.registry import get_registry, scan_and_register_custom_modules\n"
"\n"
"workspace = Path(\"/path/to/research-workspace\")\n"
"result = scan_and_register_custom_modules(workspace_path=workspace, registry=get_registry())\n"
"print(result)\n"
msgstr ""
"from pathlib import Path\n"
"from agentsociety2.registry import get_registry, scan_and_register_custom_modules\n"
"\n"
"workspace = Path(\"/path/to/research-workspace\")\n"
"result = scan_and_register_custom_modules(workspace_path=workspace, registry=get_registry())\n"
"print(result)\n"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:47
#, python-brace-format
msgid "检查返回的 `errors` 后再引用自定义类。类定义与最小实现见 {doc}`custom_modules`；技能目录见 {doc}`agent_skills`。"
msgstr ""
"Check the returned `errors` before referring to custom classes. See "
"{doc}`custom_modules` for class definitions and minimal implementations, and "
"{doc}`agent_skills` for skill directories."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:49
msgid "预填充参数"
msgstr "Prefill Parameters"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:51
msgid "`.agentsociety/prefill_params.json` 保存工作区的可复用默认参数，基础结构如下："
msgstr ""
"`.agentsociety/prefill_params.json` stores reusable workspace defaults with this base"
" structure:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:53
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n"
"  \"env_modules\": {},\n"
"  \"agents\": {}\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n"
"  \"env_modules\": {},\n"
"  \"agents\": {}\n"
"}\n"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:61
msgid "以注册表中的模块标识符为键添加默认参数。最终实验配置仍需符合实际构造函数和配置模型；预填充文件不会替代参数校验或自动改变已经生成的实验配置。"
msgstr ""
"Add defaults keyed by registry module identifiers. Final experiment configuration "
"must still match actual constructors and configuration models; prefill does not "
"replace validation or automatically change an existing generated experiment "
"configuration."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:63
msgid "在工作台的参数查看器中检查和编辑预填充信息。"
msgstr "Inspect and edit prefill information in the workbench parameter viewer."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:64
#, python-brace-format
msgid "运行前核对 `init_config.json` 与 `steps.yaml`，配置模型见 {doc}`api/config`。"
msgstr ""
"Check `init_config.json` and `steps.yaml` before execution; see {doc}`api/config` for"
" configuration models."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/module_and_parameter_management.md:65
#, python-brace-format
msgid "后端的类查询与预填充接口见 {doc}`api/backend`，运行中的请求字段以 `/docs` 为准。"
msgstr ""
"See {doc}`api/backend` for class-query and prefill endpoints, and the running `/docs`"
" for request fields."
